"专项附加扣除（元/月）" = "Additional Deductions (CNY/month)";
"专项附加扣除怎么填？" = "How should I enter additional deductions?";
"填写个人所得税专项附加扣除的月度合计，例如子女教育、继续教育、住房贷款利息、住房租金、赡养老人等。没有符合条件的扣除项目就填 0。这里填的是税前扣除额，不是实际报销金额。" = "Enter the monthly total of eligible individual income tax deductions, such as children's education, continuing education, mortgage interest, rent or support for elderly dependants. Enter 0 if none apply. This is a pre-tax deduction, not a reimbursement amount.";
"没有符合条件的项目就填 0；不确定时可先填 0" = "Enter 0 if no eligible deductions apply; use 0 if unsure.";
"预计税后月薪" = "Estimated Net Monthly Salary";
"含社保、公积金个人缴纳扣除" = "After employee social insurance and housing fund contributions";
"预计月度个税" = "Estimated Monthly Income Tax";
"上海职工社保个人比例默认 10.5%（养老 8% + 医疗 2% + 失业 0.5%），公积金默认 7%，均可修改。社保和公积金基数分别填写，按本人实际申报基数为准；上海 2026 社保基数为 7,546～37,731 元，公积金基数为 2,740～37,731 元。专项附加扣除填写你实际享受的月度扣除合计。个税按全年 12 个月工资相同估算，实际金额会受累计预扣、年终奖及其他扣除影响。" = "Default employee social insurance contributions in Shanghai are 10.5% (8% pension, 2% medical and 0.5% unemployment); the default housing fund rate is 7%. Both are editable. Enter the actual declared bases separately. Shanghai's 2026 social insurance base is CNY 7,546–37,731 and the housing fund base is CNY 2,740–37,731. Enter the monthly total of deductions you actually receive. Tax is estimated using 12 equal salary months; actual tax may differ due to cumulative withholding, bonuses and other deductions.";
