"开启后，今日收入、本周 / 本月累计、时薪和日薪均显示为遮罩；工作进度百分比仍正常显示。可通过挂件上的眼睛图标快速切换。" = "When enabled, today's earnings, weekly and monthly totals, hourly rate and daily rate are hidden. Work progress remains visible. Toggle this quickly using the eye icon on the widget.";
"启用后需要允许 macOS 通知权限。提醒每天在设定时间触发；修改工作时间不会自动改变提醒时间。若未收到通知，先点击“发送测试通知”检查权限和系统投递。" = "Allow notifications in macOS when prompted. The reminder is sent daily at the configured time. Changing working hours does not change the reminder time. If no notification arrives, use Send Test Notification to check permissions and delivery.";
"官方节假日和补班安排优先于每周规则；关闭节假日日历后，仅按上方星期设置计算。" = "Official public holidays and make-up workdays take precedence over the weekly schedule. When the holiday calendar is disabled, only the weekday settings above are used.";
"午休时段会从有效计薪时间中扣除" = "Lunch breaks are excluded from paid working time";
"开启后，挂件平时只显示今日收入和进度条。鼠标移入挂件会自动展开全部统计，移出后收起。点击挂件可以固定展开；展开状态下点击收起图标可恢复自动收起。" = "When enabled, the widget normally shows only today's earnings and progress bar. Hover to expand all statistics; move away to collapse. Click to pin it open, then use the collapse icon to restore automatic collapsing.";
"也可以直接点击桌面挂件顶部的锁形图标快速锁定或解锁。" = "You can also lock or unlock it using the lock icon at the top of the desktop widget.";
"日薪 = 月薪 ÷ 当月计薪工作日；时薪 = 日薪 ÷ 每日有效工时。本周和本月累计包含已完成工作日及今天的实时进度。午休不计薪。" = "Daily rate = monthly salary ÷ paid workdays this month. Hourly rate = daily rate ÷ effective working hours per day. Weekly and monthly totals include completed workdays and today's live progress. Lunch breaks are unpaid.";
