"实际记录与每日估算按类型分别取较大值，不会重复相加。只有对应类型开启工时扣除时，估算才会影响有效工时；设置为 0 分钟即可关闭该类型估算。估算仅用于工作日，午休和下班时间不会计入有效工时扣除。" = "Actual records and daily estimates use the greater value for each category, rather than being added together. Estimates affect effective work only when deduction is enabled for that category. Set a value to 0 to disable its estimate. Estimates apply on workdays only; scheduled lunch and after-hours are excluded.";
"折算时薪按当日预计工资 ÷（计划工作时长 − 已记录且设置为扣除的休息时长）计算；不改变原有工资发放和收入累计。" = "Adjusted hourly pay = estimated daily pay ÷ (scheduled work time − the combined actual and estimated break deduction). This does not change salary or earnings calculations.";

